      "@id": "ko:article/sp-h-standard-library-c",
      "@type": "ko:Article",
      "title": "sp.h is the standard library that C deserves",
      "url": "https://spader.zone/sp/",
      "publishedDate": "2026-05-28",
      "readDate": "2026-05-28",
      "language": "en",
      "abstract": "The article introduces sp.h, a high-quality, ultra-portable standard library for C that does not depend on libc except when required by the platform. It highlights the principles of direct programming against syscalls and the design of a single-header library.",
